[{"number": 1, "blocks": [{"text": "3-DAY BEGINNER COURSE", "x": 685800, "y": 1238250}, {"text": "Motion Design in Blender", "x": 685800, "y": 1790700}, {"text": "Turn ideas into motion.\nTurn motion into products.", "x": 723900, "y": 3619500}, {"text": "Cliofas Denis,\ndenis.cliofas@fhgr.ch", "x": 723900, "y": 5219700}, {"text": "Motion Design in Blender", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "01", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image1.webp", "width": 1672, "height": 941, "animated": false}], "links": ["mailto:denis.cliofas@fhgr.ch"]}, {"number": 2, "blocks": [{"text": "Course assessment :\nLooped satisfying animation", "x": 685800, "y": 1219200}, {"text": "The class project is a satisfying 10-second animation loop:\na pulse activates a simple geometric system, builds toward a reveal, and returns cleanly to the first frame.", "x": 704850, "y": 2476500}, {"text": "10 sec", "x": 704850, "y": 4524375}, {"text": "minimum duration", "x": 704850, "y": 4914900}, {"text": "Full HD", "x": 2200275, "y": 4524375}, {"text": "1920 x 1080 render", "x": 2200275, "y": 4914900}, {"text": "30 fps", "x": 3695700, "y": 4524375}, {"text": "minimum frame rate", "x": 3695700, "y": 4914900}, {"text": "Loop", "x": 5191125, "y": 4524375}, {"text": "frame 301 matches frame 1", "x": 5191125, "y": 4914900}, {"text": "What You Will Create", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "02", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image1.webp", "width": 1672, "height": 941, "animated": false}], "links": []}, {"number": 3, "blocks": [{"text": "First we build together. Then you make it yours.", "x": 685800, "y": 1219200}, {"text": "The course moves from motion principles to Blender practice, then into an independent loop using the same process.", "x": 704850, "y": 2476500}, {"text": "Course Structure", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "02", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "Day 1", "x": 781050, "y": 3886200}, {"text": "Foundations", "x": 781050, "y": 4286250}, {"text": "Day 2", "x": 4305300, "y": 3886200}, {"text": "Rhythm", "x": 4305300, "y": 4286250}, {"text": "Day 3", "x": 7829550, "y": 3886200}, {"text": "Reveal", "x": 7829550, "y": 4286250}, {"text": "Blender basics, scene setup, first beautiful movement.", "x": 781050, "y": 4800600}, {"text": "Relay timing, staggered actions, composition build.", "x": 4305300, "y": 4800600}, {"text": "Loop closure, render setup, independent project launch.", "x": 7829550, "y": 4800600}], "assets": [], "links": []}, {"number": 4, "blocks": [{"text": "Your final project proves the process transfers.", "x": 685800, "y": 1219200}, {"text": "You will repeat the guided workflow, but change the design so the final animation is clearly your own.", "x": 704850, "y": 2457450}, {"text": "01", "x": 742950, "y": 3543300}, {"text": "Rendered video", "x": 1562100, "y": 3524250}, {"text": "MP4 or MOV, 10 seconds minimum, Full HD, 30 fps.", "x": 1562100, "y": 3905250}, {"text": "02", "x": 742950, "y": 4381500}, {"text": "Blender file", "x": 1562100, "y": 4362450}, {"text": "Clean .blend file with organized objects and animation.", "x": 1562100, "y": 4743450}, {"text": "03", "x": 742950, "y": 5219700}, {"text": "Process note", "x": 1562100, "y": 5200650}, {"text": "Reference, storyboard or beat sheet, and what changed.", "x": 1562100, "y": 5581650}, {"text": "Final Deliverables", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "04", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [], "links": []}, {"number": 5, "blocks": [{"text": "PART 1", "x": 685800, "y": 1238250}, {"text": "See and Understand Motion", "x": 685800, "y": 1790700}, {"text": "Before we touch Blender, we learn to see what movement is doing: guiding attention, creating feeling, and making ideas readable.", "x": 723900, "y": 3619500}, {"text": "Motion Design in Blender", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "01", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "Motion is a design decision.", "x": 723900, "y": 5219700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image2.webp", "width": 2172, "height": 724, "animated": false}], "links": []}, {"number": 6, "blocks": [{"text": "Motion is not decoration.", "x": 685800, "y": 1257300}, {"text": "A movement should have a job. It can point the eye, explain a relationship, prepare an action, or make a brand feel sharp, soft, playful, precise, or premium.", "x": 723900, "y": 2647950}, {"text": "Ask: what is the motion doing?", "x": 8096250, "y": 2305050}, {"text": "Watch for this in every example: what moves first, what responds, and what changes in the viewer's attention?", "x": 742950, "y": 4914900}, {"text": "Motion Is Not Decoration", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "06", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [], "links": []}, {"number": 7, "blocks": [{"text": "The same object can do opposite jobs.", "x": 685800, "y": 1104900}, {"text": "Nothing has changed except the motion design decision: timing, spacing, anticipation, and settle.", "x": 723900, "y": 1962150}, {"text": "PRECISE / PREMIUM", "x": 1104900, "y": 3105150}, {"text": "Confirm a choice", "x": 1104900, "y": 3448050}, {"text": "Fast move, tight easing, tiny overshoot.", "x": 1123950, "y": 5257800}, {"text": "Confident, technical, controlled.", "x": 1123950, "y": 5467350}, {"text": "SOFT / PLAYFUL", "x": 6629400, "y": 3105150}, {"text": "Invite attention", "x": 6629400, "y": 3448050}, {"text": "Anticipation, squash/stretch, delayed settle.", "x": 6648450, "y": 5257800}, {"text": "Friendly, curious, light.", "x": 6648450, "y": 5467350}, {"text": "Question: did the object change, or did the motion change the meaning?", "x": 876300, "y": 5981700}, {"text": "Opposite Motion Jobs", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "07", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image3.mp4", "width": 720, "height": 405, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image3.webp"}, {"src": "assets/image4.mp4", "width": 720, "height": 405, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image4.webp"}], "links": []}, {"number": 8, "blocks": [{"text": "The viewer's eye needs a path.", "x": 685800, "y": 1257300}, {"text": "Good motion creates order. It tells the viewer where to look first, what to follow next, and when the important moment has arrived.", "x": 723900, "y": 2647950}, {"text": "First. Next. Payoff.", "x": 8096250, "y": 2305050}, {"text": "Watch for this in every example: what moves first, what responds, and what changes in the viewer's attention?", "x": 742950, "y": 4914900}, {"text": "The Viewer's Eye", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "08", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [], "links": []}, {"number": 9, "blocks": [{"text": "The viewer either searches or follows.", "x": 685800, "y": 1104900}, {"text": "A clear path is not about adding arrows. It is about deciding what moves first, what waits, and what becomes important last.", "x": 723900, "y": 1962150}, {"text": "NO CLEAR PATH", "x": 1104900, "y": 3105150}, {"text": "Everything calls for attention", "x": 1104900, "y": 3448050}, {"text": "Competing motion, similar contrast, no priority.", "x": 1123950, "y": 5257800}, {"text": "The viewer has to search.", "x": 1123950, "y": 5467350}, {"text": "CLEAR VIEWER PATH", "x": 6629400, "y": 3105150}, {"text": "One cue leads to the next", "x": 6629400, "y": 3448050}, {"text": "One cue travels, objects respond in sequence.", "x": 6648450, "y": 5257800}, {"text": "The viewer knows what to follow.", "x": 6648450, "y": 5467350}, {"text": "Question: where does your eye go first, second, and third?", "x": 876300, "y": 5981700}, {"text": "Viewer Path Examples", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "09", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image5.mp4", "width": 720, "height": 405, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image5.webp"}, {"src": "assets/image6.mp4", "width": 720, "height": 405, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image6.webp"}], "links": []}, {"number": 10, "blocks": [{"text": "Motion has personality.", "x": 685800, "y": 1257300}, {"text": "The same object can feel heavy, quick, elegant, funny, technical, or luxurious. Personality comes from timing, spacing, rhythm, materials, and the way actions settle.", "x": 723900, "y": 2647950}, {"text": "Movement can feel like a brand.", "x": 8096250, "y": 2305050}, {"text": "Watch for this in every example: what moves first, what responds, and what changes in the viewer's attention?", "x": 742950, "y": 4914900}, {"text": "Motion Personality", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "10", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [], "links": []}, {"number": 11, "blocks": [{"text": "REFERENCE: NIKE AIR MAX DAY '17", "x": 685800, "y": 1181100}, {"text": "Energy can be designed.", "x": 685800, "y": 1733550}, {"text": "Watch for rhythm, sharp transitions, contrast, and how motion creates a confident sport feeling before the logo matters.", "x": 723900, "y": 3124200}, {"text": "What makes the movement feel fast and athletic?", "x": 723900, "y": 4810125}, {"text": "ManvsMachine for Nike", "x": 7372350, "y": 4454429}, {"text": "What Motion Design Does", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "11", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "WATCH VIDEO", "x": 7353300, "y": 1524000}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image7.webp", "width": 800, "height": 452, "animated": false}], "links": ["https://www.youtube.com/embed/UZYp5XFm1Mk?feature=oembed"]}, {"number": 12, "blocks": [{"text": "DISCUSSION PROMPT", "x": 685800, "y": 1181100}, {"text": "Find the attention driver.", "x": 685800, "y": 1733550}, {"text": "Watch the clip again with the sound low. Track only the element that your eye follows from shot to shot.", "x": 723900, "y": 3124200}, {"text": "If the logo disappeared, what motion would still feel like Nike?", "x": 723900, "y": 4810125}, {"text": "What Motion Design Does", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "12", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "ManvsMachine for Nike", "x": 7372350, "y": 4454429}, {"text": "WATCH VIDEO", "x": 7353300, "y": 1524000}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image7.webp", "width": 800, "height": 452, "animated": false}], "links": ["https://www.youtube.com/embed/UZYp5XFm1Mk?feature=oembed"]}, {"number": 13, "blocks": [{"text": "WHAT TO NOTICE", "x": 685800, "y": 1181100}, {"text": "Nike feels fast before the logo appears.", "x": 685800, "y": 1638300}, {"text": "The brand feeling is built by motion choices, not by the final logo alone.", "x": 723900, "y": 2609850}, {"text": "01", "x": 819150, "y": 3467100}, {"text": "Short, sharp movements make the sequence feel athletic.", "x": 1352550, "y": 3448050}, {"text": "02", "x": 819150, "y": 4038600}, {"text": "High contrast and direction changes keep the eye active.", "x": 1352550, "y": 4019550}, {"text": "03", "x": 819150, "y": 4610100}, {"text": "The rhythm accelerates toward a confident payoff.", "x": 1352550, "y": 4591050}, {"text": "04", "x": 819150, "y": 5181600}, {"text": "Even without the logo, the motion still feels like sport energy.", "x": 1352550, "y": 5162550}, {"text": "In Blender", "x": 8324850, "y": 2362200}, {"text": "Use strong silhouettes, fast spacing changes, contrast, and one clear final accent.", "x": 8324850, "y": 2895600}, {"text": "Design the energy first; the logo should feel like the result of that energy.", "x": 742950, "y": 5753100}, {"text": "Nike Motion Answer", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "13", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [], "links": []}, {"number": 14, "blocks": [{"text": "REFERENCE: SQUARESPACE / JEFF KOONS", "x": 685800, "y": 1181100}, {"text": "Reveal needs preparation.", "x": 685800, "y": 1733550}, {"text": "Watch for compression, expansion, material mood, and the moment where the visual system feels resolved.", "x": 723900, "y": 3124200}, {"text": "Where is the anticipation? Where is the payoff?", "x": 723900, "y": 4810125}, {"text": "WATCH VIDEO", "x": 7353300, "y": 1524000}, {"text": "ManvsMachine for Squarespace", "x": 7372350, "y": 4437816}, {"text": "What Motion Design Does", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "14", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image8.webp", "width": 800, "height": 452, "animated": false}], "links": ["https://www.youtube.com/embed/w3_Z6V0DH1M?feature=oembed"]}, {"number": 15, "blocks": [{"text": "WHAT TO NOTICE", "x": 685800, "y": 1181100}, {"text": "A reveal works because it is prepared.", "x": 685800, "y": 1638300}, {"text": "The satisfying moment is not only the reveal. It is the setup before it.", "x": 723900, "y": 2609850}, {"text": "01", "x": 819150, "y": 3467100}, {"text": "Compression creates anticipation before expansion.", "x": 1352550, "y": 3448050}, {"text": "02", "x": 819150, "y": 4038600}, {"text": "Material, light, and shape make the motion feel premium.", "x": 1352550, "y": 4019550}, {"text": "03", "x": 819150, "y": 4610100}, {"text": "The pace slows when the viewer needs to understand the image.", "x": 1352550, "y": 4591050}, {"text": "04", "x": 819150, "y": 5181600}, {"text": "The payoff feels resolved because the motion settles.", "x": 1352550, "y": 5162550}, {"text": "In Blender", "x": 8324850, "y": 2362200}, {"text": "Animate scale, spacing, and settle. Let materials and lighting support the mood.", "x": 8324850, "y": 2895600}, {"text": "A good reveal gives the viewer a reason to expect the final frame.", "x": 742950, "y": 5753100}, {"text": "Reveal Answer", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "15", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [], "links": []}, {"number": 16, "blocks": [{"text": "REFERENCE: BUCK / GITHUB", "x": 685800, "y": 1181100}, {"text": "Motion can explain an idea.", "x": 685800, "y": 1733550}, {"text": "Watch how visual metaphors connect scenes. The motion keeps the viewer oriented even when the graphics change.", "x": 723900, "y": 3124200}, {"text": "What idea is being explained through movement?", "x": 723900, "y": 4810125}, {"text": "WATCH VIDEO", "x": 7353300, "y": 1524000}, {"text": "BUCK for GitHub", "x": 7372350, "y": 4437816}, {"text": "What Motion Design Does", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "16", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image9.webp", "width": 800, "height": 452, "animated": false}], "links": ["https://www.youtube.com/embed/pBy1zgt0XPc?feature=oembed"]}, {"number": 17, "blocks": [{"text": "WHAT TO NOTICE", "x": 685800, "y": 1181100}, {"text": "Motion keeps the idea connected.", "x": 685800, "y": 1638300}, {"text": "When graphics change, movement can preserve meaning across the cut.", "x": 723900, "y": 2609850}, {"text": "01", "x": 819150, "y": 3467100}, {"text": "Repeated directions help scenes feel related.", "x": 1352550, "y": 3448050}, {"text": "02", "x": 819150, "y": 4038600}, {"text": "Transformations show cause and effect.", "x": 1352550, "y": 4019550}, {"text": "03", "x": 819150, "y": 4610100}, {"text": "Visual metaphors become clearer when motion links them.", "x": 1352550, "y": 4591050}, {"text": "04", "x": 819150, "y": 5181600}, {"text": "The viewer follows the idea, not just the objects.", "x": 1352550, "y": 5162550}, {"text": "In Blender", "x": 8324850, "y": 2362200}, {"text": "Use matching paths, repeated timing, and object transformations to connect shots.", "x": 8324850, "y": 2895600}, {"text": "If the objects change, motion can still make the story feel continuous.", "x": 742950, "y": 5753100}, {"text": "Explanation Answer", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "17", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [], "links": []}, {"number": 18, "blocks": [{"text": "REFERENCE: 3D LOOPING TOY", "x": 685800, "y": 1181100}, {"text": "Satisfying motion has a clear chain.", "x": 685800, "y": 1733550}, {"text": "Watch for trigger, reaction, transfer, resolution, and reset. The loop feels good because the return is motivated.", "x": 723900, "y": 3124200}, {"text": "Can you find the exact moment the loop restarts?", "x": 723900, "y": 4810125}, {"text": "WATCH VIDEO", "x": 7353300, "y": 1524000}, {"text": "Flowing Pixels", "x": 7353300, "y": 4436471}, {"text": "What Motion Design Does", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "18", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image10.webp", "width": 800, "height": 452, "animated": false}], "links": ["https://www.youtube.com/embed/5Z2wYyCMLz4?feature=oembed"]}, {"number": 19, "blocks": [{"text": "WHAT TO NOTICE", "x": 685800, "y": 1181100}, {"text": "The loop works because every action causes the next.", "x": 685800, "y": 1638300}, {"text": "Satisfying motion feels inevitable: trigger, response, payoff, reset.", "x": 723900, "y": 2609850}, {"text": "01", "x": 819150, "y": 3467100}, {"text": "One clear trigger starts the chain.", "x": 1352550, "y": 3448050}, {"text": "02", "x": 819150, "y": 4038600}, {"text": "Each reaction has visible cause and effect.", "x": 1352550, "y": 4019550}, {"text": "03", "x": 819150, "y": 4610100}, {"text": "The reset is hidden inside the motion logic.", "x": 1352550, "y": 4591050}, {"text": "04", "x": 819150, "y": 5181600}, {"text": "The loop feels complete because the final state invites the first action again.", "x": 1352550, "y": 5162550}, {"text": "In Blender", "x": 8324850, "y": 2362200}, {"text": "Build one animated chain first. Then make the last frame lead naturally into frame one.", "x": 8324850, "y": 2895600}, {"text": "A seamless loop is not just repetition. It is a motivated return.", "x": 742950, "y": 5753100}, {"text": "Loop Answer", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "19", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [], "links": []}, {"number": 20, "blocks": [{"text": "PART 2", "x": 685800, "y": 1238250}, {"text": "Core Motion Principles", "x": 685800, "y": 1790700}, {"text": "Now we turn motion into craft: timing, spacing, easing, anticipation, overshoot, rhythm, and the final settle.", "x": 723900, "y": 3619500}, {"text": "Core Motion Principles", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "01", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "Good motion is built, not guessed.", "x": 723900, "y": 5219700}, {"text": "Timing & Spacing\nEasing\nMass & Weight\nAnticipation\nArcs\nSquash & Stretch\nFollow Through & Overlap\nExageration\nSecondary Animation\nAppeal", "x": 5937869, "y": 400050}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image1.webp", "width": 1672, "height": 941, "animated": false}, {"src": "assets/image1.webp", "width": 1672, "height": 941, "animated": false}], "links": []}, {"number": 21, "blocks": [{"text": "Timing and spacing create rhythm.", "x": 685800, "y": 1104900}, {"text": "Timing sets duration. Spacing shapes speed from frame to frame. Rhythm relates one action to the next.", "x": 723900, "y": 1962150}, {"text": "SHORT TIMING", "x": 1200150, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Fast decision", "x": 1200150, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "Feels sharp, urgent, confident, or surprising.", "x": 1200150, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "LONG TIMING", "x": 6667500, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Slow arrival", "x": 6667500, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "Feels deliberate, heavy, elegant, or important.", "x": 6667500, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "Ask: Should this action feel instant, deliberate, or earned?", "x": 876300, "y": 5734050}, {"text": "Timing & Spacing", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "22", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image11.mp4", "width": 960, "height": 360, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image11.webp"}, {"src": "assets/image12.mp4", "width": 960, "height": 360, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image12.webp"}], "links": []}, {"number": 22, "blocks": [{"text": "Easing decides how speed changes.", "x": 685800, "y": 1104900}, {"text": "The path can stay identical while acceleration and deceleration change the feeling.", "x": 723900, "y": 1962150}, {"text": "LINEAR", "x": 1200150, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "No change in speed", "x": 1200150, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "Clear and technical, but often lifeless for character or product motion.", "x": 1200150, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "EASED", "x": 6667500, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Speed has shape", "x": 6667500, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "The move accelerates, slows down, and feels more physical.", "x": 6667500, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "Ask: Should the movement feel mechanical, soft or decisive?", "x": 876300, "y": 5734050}, {"text": "Easing", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "24", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image13.mp4", "width": 960, "height": 360, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image13.webp"}, {"src": "assets/image14.mp4", "width": 960, "height": 360, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image14.webp"}], "links": []}, {"number": 23, "blocks": [{"text": "Weight appears through response.", "x": 685800, "y": 1104900}, {"text": "Acceleration, impact, bounce and settling tell the viewer how much mass an object has.", "x": 723900, "y": 1962150}, {"text": "LIGHT WEIGHT", "x": 1200150, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Object feels light weight", "x": 1200150, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "Fast impacts and high bounces reduce sense of weight.", "x": 1200150, "y": 4101336}, {"text": "HEAVY WEIGHT", "x": 6667500, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Object feels heavy", "x": 6667500, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "Fall time, impact spacing and settling suggest weight.", "x": 6667500, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "Ask: Which timing decisions make one object feel heavier?", "x": 876300, "y": 5734050}, {"text": "WEIGHT", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "05", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image15.mp4", "width": 360, "height": 960, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image15.webp"}, {"src": "assets/image16.mp4", "width": 360, "height": 960, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image16.webp"}], "links": []}, {"number": 24, "blocks": [{"text": "Anticipation prepares the viewer.", "x": 685800, "y": 1104900}, {"text": "Mass is communicated by acceleration, impact, deformation, bounce and the time required to settle.", "x": 723900, "y": 1962150}, {"text": "NO ANTICIPATION", "x": 1200150, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Action appears suddenly", "x": 1200150, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "The viewer reacts after the movement has already started.", "x": 1200150, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "WITH ANTICIPATION", "x": 6667500, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Action feels motivated", "x": 6667500, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "A small pullback or compression tells the eye what is coming.", "x": 6667500, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "Ask: what tiny movement can prepare the big one?", "x": 876300, "y": 5734050}, {"text": "Anticipation", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "25", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image17.mp4", "width": 960, "height": 360, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image17.webp"}, {"src": "assets/image18.mp4", "width": 960, "height": 360, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image18.webp"}], "links": []}, {"number": 25, "blocks": [{"text": "Arcs make motion feel intentional.", "x": 685800, "y": 1104900}, {"text": "Curved paths turn simple translation into a fluid gesture shaped by joints or forces.", "x": 723900, "y": 1962150}, {"text": "NO ARCS", "x": 1200150, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Path feels mechanical", "x": 1200150, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "A rigid straight line can make the action feel diagrammatic.", "x": 1200150, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "WITH ARCS", "x": 6667500, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Path feels gestural", "x": 6667500, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "A controlled arc reveals swing, direction and physical intent.", "x": 6667500, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "Ask: What kind of force or pivot should shape the path?", "x": 876300, "y": 5734050}, {"text": "ARCS", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "07", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image19.mp4", "width": 960, "height": 360, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image19.webp"}, {"src": "assets/image20.mp4", "width": 960, "height": 360, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image20.webp"}], "links": []}, {"number": 26, "blocks": [{"text": "Squash and stretch reveal force.", "x": 685800, "y": 1104900}, {"text": "Temporary deformation makes acceleration, flexibility and impact visible.", "x": 723900, "y": 1962150}, {"text": "NO SQUASH & STRETCH", "x": 1200150, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Force stays invisible", "x": 1200150, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "Rigid geometry hides compression and acceleration.", "x": 1200150, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "WITH SQUASH & STRETCH", "x": 6667500, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Force becomes readable", "x": 6667500, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "Opposing scale changes show impact while preserving volume.", "x": 6667500, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "Ask: Where should the object compress or elongate?", "x": 876300, "y": 5734050}, {"text": "SQUASH and STRETCH", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "08", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image21.mp4", "width": 960, "height": 360, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image21.webp"}, {"src": "assets/image22.mp4", "width": 960, "height": 360, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image22.webp"}], "links": []}, {"number": 27, "blocks": [{"text": "Follow-through and overlap.", "x": 685800, "y": 1104900}, {"text": "Different parts of a system respond and settle at different moments.", "x": 723900, "y": 1962150}, {"text": "NO FOLLOW-THROUGH", "x": 1200150, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Everything stops at once", "x": 1200150, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "A simultaneous stop removes momentum and flexibility.", "x": 1200150, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "WITH FOLLOW-THROUGH", "x": 6667500, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Motion settles in layers", "x": 6667500, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "Delayed responses show what leads, follows and settles last.", "x": 6667500, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "Ask: What should continue moving after the main action ends?", "x": 876300, "y": 5734050}, {"text": "FOLLOW-THROUGH", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "09", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image23.mp4", "width": 960, "height": 360, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image23.webp"}, {"src": "assets/image24.mp4", "width": 960, "height": 360, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image24.webp"}], "links": []}, {"number": 28, "blocks": [{"text": "Exaggeration clarifies the idea.", "x": 685800, "y": 1104900}, {"text": "A perfect stop can feel dead. A small exaggeration gives the object a memory of its speed.", "x": 723899, "y": 2095500}, {"text": "HARD STOP", "x": 1200150, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Abrupt ending", "x": 1200150, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "Useful for precise UI motion, but can feel stiff.", "x": 1200150, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "OVER + SETTLE", "x": 6667500, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Satisfying ending", "x": 6667500, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "The object passes the target slightly, then resolves.", "x": 6667500, "y": 3771900}, {"text": "Ask: Which single part of the action deserves to be pushed?", "x": 876300, "y": 5734050}, {"text": "Overshoot and Settle", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "26", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image25.mp4", "width": 960, "height": 360, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image25.webp"}, {"src": "assets/image26.mp4", "width": 960, "height": 360, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image26.webp"}], "links": []}, {"number": 29, "blocks": [{"text": "Secondary motion supports the action.", "x": 685800, "y": 1104900}, {"text": "A restrained supporting response can connect cause and effect without stealing focus.", "x": 723900, "y": 1962150}, {"text": "NO SECONDARY MOTION", "x": 1200150, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Everything competes", "x": 1200150, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "Supporting reactions are as strong as the main event.", "x": 1200150, "y": 4128622}, {"text": "WITH SECONDARY MOTION", "x": 6667500, "y": 2990850}, {"text": "Hierarchy stays clear", "x": 6667500, "y": 3333750}, {"text": "Smaller delayed reactions reinforce the primary action.", "x": 6667500, "y": 4128622}, {"text": "Ask: Does the supporting motion strengthen or distract?", "x": 876300, "y": 5734050}, {"text": "SECONDARY MOTION", "x": 685800, "y": 6362700}, {"text": "11", "x": 10896600, "y": 6362700}], "assets": [{"src": "assets/image27.mp4", "width": 360, "height": 960, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image27.webp"}, {"src": "assets/image28.mp4", "width": 360, "height": 960, "animated": true, "poster": "assets/image28.webp"}], "links": []}]